\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Request flow. The agent sends a question (1); the planner turns it into a QuerySpec without seeing the stored record (2); the gate checks the QuerySpec against the user's grant and picks the coarsest release level (3; step 7 in the gate box is the daily limit); only the per-user vault reads health data, computes the answer and builds the packet (4); the packet and a receipt identifier return to the agent (5). The planner holds no access to data or policy.}}{6}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
